# Kebap — `lib/` conventions

Package `kebap`. Import mới: `package:kebap/...`.

## Feature layout

```text
lib/features/<feature>/
  domain/
    entities/          # freezed domain models
    repositories/      # abstract contracts
    usecases/          # optional — complex / reusable logic
  data/
    repositories/      # *RepositoryImpl implements contract
    # mappers nếu cần (Drift row → entity)
  presentation/
    screens/ | widgets/
    providers/         # @riverpod / Notifier / Stream
```

Shared infra: `lib/core/db/`, `lib/core/router/`, `lib/core/theme/`.

## Domain

```dart
// entity — pure Dart / freezed
@freezed
class WorkoutSession with _$WorkoutSession {
  const factory WorkoutSession({required String id, ...}) = _WorkoutSession;
}

// contract
abstract class WorkoutRepository {
  Stream<List<WorkoutSession>> watchRecent();
  Future<void> saveSet(...);
}

// use case — pure, testable không Flutter
class CompareSessions {
  const CompareSessions();
  SessionDiff call(WorkoutSession current, WorkoutSession previous) { ... }
}
```

## Data

- Repository impl inject DAO / `AppDatabase`, map sang domain entity.
- Truy vấn đặc thù (vd. buổi tham chiếu theo `docs/03` mục 5) nằm trong **DAO**, không rải ở UI.
- Không trả Drift row ra ngoài data layer.

```dart
class WorkoutRepositoryImpl implements WorkoutRepository {
  WorkoutRepositoryImpl(this._dao);
  final WorkoutDao _dao;

  @override
  Stream<List<WorkoutSession>> watchRecent() =>
      _dao.watchRecent().map((rows) => rows.map(WorkoutMapper.toEntity).toList());
}
```

## Presentation + Riverpod

- Provider mới dùng `riverpod_generator` (`@riverpod`).
- Wire graph tường minh: db → dao → repository → (use case) → UI provider.
- Đọc: `StreamProvider` / generated stream trên `repository.watch*()`.
- Ghi: method trên `Notifier` / repository; UI không gọi DAO.
- State UI tạm (focus, animation): hooks/`StatefulWidget` local — không nhét vào domain.

```dart
@riverpod
WorkoutRepository workoutRepository(Ref ref) {
  return WorkoutRepositoryImpl(ref.watch(workoutDaoProvider));
}

@riverpod
Stream<List<WorkoutSession>> recentWorkouts(Ref ref) {
  return ref.watch(workoutRepositoryProvider).watchRecent();
}
```

## Naming

| Thứ | Quy ước |
|-----|---------|
| File | `snake_case.dart` |
| Entity | `PascalCase` freezed |
| Contract | `FooRepository` |
| Impl | `FooRepositoryImpl` |
| Use case | verb/noun rõ nghĩa (`CompareSessions`, `CalculateOneRepMax`) |
| Screen | `*_screen.dart` / `*Screen` |

## Test

- Domain calculators / use cases: unit test thuần Dart trong `test/`.
- Volume / 1RM / so sánh / chart metrics: bám `docs/03-calculation-rules.md` và `.cursor/rules/calculation-rules.mdc`.
- DAO: `NativeDatabase.memory()`.
- Đổi schema Drift: migration + test migration bắt buộc.
- Không đặt test cạnh file `lib/`.
